{"answer": "**Budget\u2011Numbers Thread \u2013 Participants & Commitments**  \n*(Based on the conversation@1 view of thread\u202f\u201cthr\u2011group\u201d; content hash\u202f5cb6b24dc8ed7ae34615e3497492f739052db9b3bce0d717f861c20569198e89)*\n\n| Participant | Commitments (direct statements in the thread) |\n|-------------|----------------------------------------------|\n| **Alice Ander** (ct\u2011alice) | \u2022 \u201cOffsite is already committed; look at contractors.\u201d  <br>\u2022 \u201cPlease put proposals in the thread by Thursday.\u201d (no direct action attributed to Alice, but she sets the deadline) |\n| **Bob** (ct\u2011bob) | \u2022 \u201cI will take travel scenarios.\u201d <br>\u2022 \u201cContractor spend is mostly the migration project.\u201d (though this is an observation, it is accompanied by his forthcoming action) |\n| **Carol Corte** (ct\u2011carol) | \u2022 \u201cAlso the tooling renewals land in Q4.\u201d <br>\u2022 \u201cWill do.\u202fI will take tooling.\u201d |\n| **You / ct\u2011self** | \u2022 \u201cI will pull the contractor breakdown tomorrow.\u201d <br>\u2022 \u201cAnd I will reconcile against last quarter.\u201d |\n\nThese are all the explicit \u201cI will\u2026\u201d or equivalent pledges that appear in the recorded messages of", "answer_hash": "f3fa78c77e76ca172dcf7f74d1d42d79e62306ff133e6423d8904e441d25ec76", "kind": "task_end", "receipt_id": "r-14", "seq": 14, "task_id": "t2-group-thread-resolution", "truncated": false, "ts": 1017.0}
